              "text": "Added a build and preview walkthrough to **README.md** and committed it on this branch.\n\n- `harbor build` renders Markdown pages into `public/`.\n- `harbor serve -addr :8080` starts a local preview.\n- Rebuilding replaces the output directory, so generated files do not need to be checked in.\n\nI ran `go run . build` against the sample content; it rendered all three pages.",
