    "GET /file?session=4c193653&path=README.md": {
      "status": 200,
      "type": "text/plain",
      "body": "# harbor\n\nA small static site generator. harbor turns a folder of Markdown pages into HTML using Go templates.\n\n## Build and preview\n\nRun `harbor build` to render Markdown in `content/` into `public/`. Each build replaces the output directory.\n\nRun `harbor serve -addr :8080` and open http://localhost:8080/ to preview the result.\n\n## Layout\n\n- `content/` holds Markdown pages.\n- `templates/` holds Go templates.\n- `public/` holds generated HTML.\n"
